# OneDrive conflict copies. OneDrive Sync Service runs on this Mac and writes a
# duplicate named "<file> 2.ext" (or "<dir> 2") whenever it sees a concurrent
# change — two of these reached a commit before this rule existed.
#
# No tracked file in this repo uses a space in its name, so these patterns can
# only match a conflict copy. If you ever want such a filename, `git add -f` it.
#
# This only stops git from seeing the copies. It does NOT stop OneDrive creating
# them — for that, exclude this folder from OneDrive sync or move the repo out
# of ~/Documents.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
